38. ARRAY SEARCHING — LINEAR SEARCH
------------------------------------------------------------

int linearSearch(const int arr[],
                 size_t n,
                 int key)
{
    for (size_t i = 0; i < n; i++)
    {
        if (arr[i] == key)
            return (int)i;
    }

    return -1;
}


Complexity:

Best case: O(1)

Worst case: O(n)

Average case: O(n)


