39. BINARY SEARCH
------------------------------------------------------------

Binary search requires sorted data.

Example idea:

Array:

10 20 30 40 50 60 70

Search:

60

Check middle.

Eliminate half of the search space repeatedly.


Complexity:

O(log n)


A robust implementation should avoid overflow in:

mid = (low + high) / 2


Prefer:

mid = low + (high - low) / 2


