43. ARRAY REVERSE
------------------------------------------------------------

void reverse(int arr[], size_t n)
{
    size_t left = 0;
    size_t right = n;

    if (n == 0)
        return;

    right--;

    while (left < right)
    {
        int temp = arr[left];

        arr[left] = arr[right];
        arr[right] = temp;

        left++;
        right--;
    }
}


Example:

1 2 3 4 5

becomes:

5 4 3 2 1


Time:

O(n)

Extra space:

O(1)


